{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"刚才被顾虑绊住的心思又动起来，他想象自己向那人靠近一点，竟高兴得心口发烫。\",\n          \"key\": \"想再靠近一点\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"他想让那人知道自己多高兴，又怕把喜欢说得太重；这句话在心里转了几圈，渐渐静下去。\",\n          \"key\": \"想说又怕说重\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"提供理由\",\n          \"why\": \"先前想延长相处却被顾虑绊住，那个念头一直在心里打转。这回他不自觉地把想象推进了一小步，从想多待一会儿，变成想再靠近一点。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"限制\",\n          \"why\": \"他曾因怕过早看重而收住对以后相处的设想；如今想让那人知道自己有多高兴，又担心这样的表达会把喜欢说得太郑重。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"正在面对\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他已想象过主动靠近那人一点，还生出过让那人知道自己高兴的冲动。\",\n        \"一想到表达出来可能显得太郑重，他又迟疑了。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"从想延长相处推进到想主动靠近、甚至表达，能解释这一遍为何更加热切，也能承接高处近乎倾吐却又迟疑、逐渐放缓的听感。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选15\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"他一遍遍想起两人安静待着的情景，每回都像重过那一刻，心里甜得想笑。\",\n          \"key\": \"把那一刻重过几遍\",\n          \"follows\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"想到相处还只在想象里，他便想把此刻的高兴记牢；舍不得让它淡去，心里发酸，慢慢静下来。\",\n          \"key\": \"想把高兴记牢\",\n          \"follows\": true\n        }\n      ],\n      \"because\": [\n        {\n          \"item\": 1,\n          \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n          \"rel\": \"提供理由\",\n          \"why\": \"先前他想把相处延长，却总被顾虑打断，心思反复回到同一个场景；此刻那幅画面再次浮现，他便像重新经历那片刻一样沉浸其中。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"item\": 2,\n          \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n          \"rel\": \"唤起\",\n          \"why\": \"他早已为想象中的相处终会消散而心酸；这次反复回味带来了格外鲜明的快乐，使那份不舍具体变成了想把这种快乐记住的急切。\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"center_relation\": \"没在想\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始想把想象中与那人相处时得到的快乐记牢。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"这一理解把更加丰盛的甜意看作反复重温同一片刻的结果，并用想保存感受的急切解释随后的强烈心酸与缓缓平静，而非把这一段理解成向对方更进一步。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选8\", \"候选10\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a6eb96ea-dc4a-4108-ba71-16e004871e48", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T153600015927Z", "elapsed_seconds": 694.703, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T15:47:34.730056+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "81685737c8e5ae2df2eaaa14de2d817ffa352efb2cd80c0c47846adf6c02047e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T153600015927Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e95e5700af4196b791607353f2a88e8e9c115188b574ab037160feab085d2f